;;;; NYSE special closures (unscheduled full-day closes) outside the
;;;; recurring Rule 7.2 holiday list. Each block: :name, :authority, :days.
;;;; Loaded as decree-style extra days (nil FROM) on the "NYSE" calendar.
;;;;
;;;; Coverage: 1954 onward (the NYSE calendar's first modeled year).
;;;; Cross-checked against Python exchange_calendars XNYS (dates only) —
;;;; data/tests/xnys-gold.sexp. 2026: no special closure announced as of 2026-11-27.

